        "aggregate at the same position in the remaining accounts.",
        "",
        "# Errors",
        "* Pyth Lazer verification fails.",
        "* The payload does not decode or names another channel.",
        "* The remaining accounts do not match the feed count, repeat an account,",
        "or fail the price aggregate constraints.",
        "* A feed is not configured on its aggregate.",
        "* A feed property, price, or timestamp is invalid."
